    class LogRepository {
        +seal(path, kind) str
        +save_state(data) None
        +load_state() dict
        +inflight_dir() str
    }

    CDCDaemon <|-- SimulatedCDCDaemon
    CDCDaemon <|-- MySQLBinlogDaemon
    CDCDaemon <|-- PostgresWALDaemon
    PostgresWALDaemon <|-- KingbaseWALDaemon : 继承复用（钩子化）
    CDCDaemon <|-- PollingLogMinerDaemon
    PollingLogMinerDaemon <|-- OracleLogMinerDaemon
    PollingLogMinerDaemon <|-- DamengLogMnrDaemon

    CDCFactory ..> KingbaseWALDaemon : 注册/实例化
    CDCFactory ..> OracleLogMinerDaemon : 注册/实例化
    CDCFactory ..> DamengLogMnrDaemon : 注册/实例化
    CDCFactory ..> SimulatedCDCDaemon : 降级兜底
    DbRtCapture --> CDCFactory : create_daemon()
    DbRtCapture --> CDCDaemon : 持有 daemon
    CDCDaemon --> LogRepository : seal / save_state
